      "Code": "keys = IN[1]\r\nvalues = IN[2]\r\n\r\noutput = dict()\r\n\r\n\r\nif keys and values:\r\n    for k, v in zip(keys, values):\r\n        output[k] = v\r\n    \r\nOUT = output ",
